<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jacor featured.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jacor featured.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it made Jacor Communications Inc its featured stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 28.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
